# Tessera — the organ: Glass's portable combo organ. Square core with a
# square octave, held (sustain 0.8) so the additive triplet figures read
# as a continuous reed of notes, gated only by the song's note gaps.
# A small filter ping gives each note a consonant; the ladder stays
# half-shut so it sits under the marimbas instead of beside them.
waveform 1
pulse_width 0.5
osc2_wave 1
osc2_pitch 12
osc2_level 0.3
osc3_wave 0
osc3_pitch 0
osc3_level 0
detune 3
sub 0
circuit 0
key_track 0.5
attack 0.003
decay 0.2
sustain 0.8
release 0.05
filter_env 0.4
filter_attack 0.001
filter_decay 0.1
filter_sustain 0.5
filter_release 0.05
cutoff 1800
resonance 0.3
drive 1.2
saturation 1.0
hpf 140
volume 0.4
